{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43519","headline":"与耿湋水亭咏风联句 · 颜真卿","name":"与耿湋水亭咏风联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清风何处起，拂槛复萦洲。\n回入飘华幕，轻来叠晚流。\n桃竹今已展，羽翣且从收。\n经竹吹弥切，过松韵更幽。\n直散青苹末，偏随白浪头。\n山山催雨过，浦浦发行舟。\n动树蝉争噪，开帘客罢愁。\n度弦方解愠，临水已迎秋。\n凉爲开襟至，清因作颂留。\n周回随远梦，骚屑满离忧。\n岂独销繁暑，偏能入迥楼。\n王风今若此，谁不荷明休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"颜真卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43519.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43519","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}